/.candle-flash-attn/*
!/.candle-flash-attn/.gitkeep
/target

# Golden-tensor test fixtures (~27 MB) are derived artifacts: regenerate with
# `crates/sd-upscale/python/dump_*_fixture.py`. The parity tests that consume
# them also need the (uncommitted) model weights from the local HF cache, so
# there's no point committing the fixtures — a fresh clone needs local setup
# either way. The tiny `assets/empty_prompt_embed.safetensors` is NOT ignored:
# it's `include_bytes!`'d into the binary, so it's a required build input.
/crates/sd-upscale/tests/fixtures/*.safetensors
